# DNS codebase

- Implement DNS concepts clearly: resolver, cache, TTL, record types (A, AAAA, CNAME, MX, NS, TXT).
- Keep modules small and testable; one concern per file when the repo grows.
- Match existing language/style in the tree before introducing new patterns.
- Add tests only for non-trivial resolver/cache/serialization behavior.
